	(text "PIC16F13145: CLB compares A0..A4 with CLBSWIN -> CSB (RC5). STOP chain on RB4/RB5. MSSP I2C client on RB6/RB7. LED on RA2. ICSP on RA0/RA1/MCLR. AUX4..7 (node-local, e.g. DRDY#/START/EN/INT by convention) on RC7/RA4/RA5/RC6."
